      {
        "id": 56444,
        "name": "arenson9",
        "username": "arenson9",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-22T16:16:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I am by no means an expert. I am also by no means a representative of Greater Than Games in this area.</p><p>Having said that, my intuition is that if you were charging for the app, it would be a clear violoation of copyright to use the images, and the fact that you are not charging puts you at best into a gray area.</p><p>I recommend contacting them and asking permission. Whether or not you _need_ their permission is perhaps debatable. It is certainly, in my opinion, however, the nice thing to do.</p>",
